carmt kernel work, Nov 2026. RTX 5880 Ada (mbz_nlp2.07, GPU 1), GDN-2 370M + ARMT (32 memory tokens, d_mem 64),
batch 8 x 8192 tokens (8 segments of 1024), bf16 autocast, TF32 on (as train.py).

In-process A/B (two library builds on one model, training steps alternated A, B, A, B, ... so both see the same
thermal state; median of 10 rounds; per-round ratios in parentheses). Each line: the change against the build before it.

